.monai-bundles
# MONAI model weights are never committed: they are large, re-downloadable and
# already versioned in the Model Zoo. Only the configs-only bundle is vendored;
# weights are supplied at build time via --resources-dir. This is a backstop in
# case a local sync ever writes them (see notes/monai-weights-plan.md).
/src/**/*_bundle/models/
/resources/*-bundle/
